OL,3,GNEWSAFamily hubs set to launch across
OL,4,Aborough
OL,5,
OL,6,FFamilies are being encouraged to attend
OL,7,Fspecial events to celebrate the launch
OL,8,Fof six "one-stop shops" that will be
OL,9,Fused for a range of support across a
OL,10,FBerkshire borough.
OL,12,FWokingham Borough Council said it would
OL,13,Fhold events at each of its six Best
OL,14,FStart Family Hubs later this month and
OL,15,Fearly next month.
OL,17,FIt said it wanted them to be places
OL,18,Fwhere children, young people and
OL,19,Fparents could go for support, advice
OL,20,Fand activities.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
